From d4995344a679c70f640092c963072433683dc9c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sai Prasad <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:10:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] RC I: 3D Phyto Helios split into HTML, CSS and JS

Replace the 2D index.html with the 3D simulator:
- index.html, css/style.css, js/app.js (ES modules, three.js r160)
- assets/models: plant, sun, magnifier, stem section, sundial (glTF)
- assets/screenshots for the README
- README: sections, screenshots, credits, releases; GPL-3.0 licence line
- Remove assets/Gitkeep
---
 README.md                           |    4 +-
 assets/Gitkeep                      |    1 -
 assets/models/avocado.glb           |  Bin 0 -> 1129624 bytes
 assets/models/magnifier.glb         |  Bin 0 -> 80540 bytes
 assets/models/stem.glb              |  Bin 0 -> 112892 bytes
